a whole value function,

00:23:49.551 --> 00:23:51.832
a separate entity
called a critic and

00:23:51.833 --> 00:23:55.389
stick it directly into that
definition of the gradient.

00:23:55.390 --> 00:23:58.430
So this is the same estimate
